diff --git a/README b/README
index 1726b93..7f611bf 100644
--- a/README
+++ b/README
@@ -24,6 +24,11 @@ USAGE
 -------
 On Android the five checkboxes at the top represent the three mouse buttons and mousewheel, determining which "buttons" are clicked. The "kb" button toggles the soft keyboard.
 
+For a local graphical runtime that already owns a connected stream, `-D`
+exports drawterm's namespace directly as 9P on standard input and output.
+It skips dialing, authentication, and the rcpu shell handshake while retaining
+`/dev/draw`, `/dev/mouse`, `/dev/kbd`, and `/dev/snarf`.
+
 
 CAVEATS
 --------
