@@ -76,6 +76,18 @@ Start drawterm in 9P mode;
 exporting the namespace over 9P on standard input and output.
 Graphics and keyboard input are disabled.
 
+.TP
+.B -D
+Export the graphical drawterm namespace directly over 9P on file
+descriptors 0 and 1.  Dialing, authentication, and the
+.IR rcpu (1)
+shell handshake are skipped.  The exported namespace includes
+.IR draw (3),
+.IR mouse (3),
+.IR kbd (3),
+and the clipboard device.  The inherited transport is assumed to be
+trusted; this mode is intended for a local supervisor and guest runtime.
+
 .TP
 .B -G
 Start drawterm in text-only mode (no graphics).
